{"type":"item.completed","item":{"id":"item_3","type":"command_execution","command":"/bin/bash -lc 'git status --short --branch\ngit rev-parse HEAD\ngit log -10 --oneline'","aggregated_output":"## main\n M packages/axylo/test/browser/a11y/util.ts\n M packages/axylo/test/browser/acceptance/i1-pointer.browser.test.ts\n M packages/axylo/test/browser/acceptance/util.ts\n M packages/axylo/test/browser/harness.ts\n?? bench/history/20261118T035036Z-first-3x120-uplot-vs-axylo-svg-956e.json\n?? bench/history/20261118T035037Z-first-1x100000-uplot-vs-axylo-svg-5708.json\n?? reviews/2026-11-18/impl/wp/core-final.controller.review.events.jsonl\n?? reviews/2026-11-18/impl/wp/core-final.controller.review.md\n?? reviews/2026-11-18/impl/wp/core-final.interaction.review.events.jsonl\n?? reviews/2026-11-18/impl/wp/core-final.interaction.review.md\n285c1b32a46bc61e6a7cca83c003ce6a0b6b319c\n285c1b3 Briefs for the final cross-provider reviews of the core\na518cbb Docs without the React adapter; a plain lifecycle example; React dev dependencies removed\nb8d531d Distribution suite without the React adapter; create, destroy, create tested on the packed core (Claude Opus 5.5 high)\n618429e Benchmark harness: instrumented and release builds kept apart; a GPU mode and a second decision family (Claude Opus 5.5 high)\nbf93e1a React adapter removed from 1.0, as the owner decided on 2026-11-18\ndac5664 Docs and distribution tests follow the restructured library, the minified stylesheet and the new palette\n5dc837e Owner decisions: size targets 96 / 80 / 2 KiB; palette B checked independently; machine limits corrected\n37ed261 Per-chart composition: importing one chart type no longer carries the other four (Claude Opus 5.5 high)\nbe742ac Brief for the independent check of the adopted palette\n9861f54 Default palette: candidate B adopted, as the owner chose on 2026-11-18 (Claude Opus 5.5 xhigh)\n","exit_code":0,"status":"completed"}}
